          "Strict-write protocol (guarded): Call the action with validateOnly=true and the complete business arguments; nothing is written. Copy the returned expectedStateHash credential without changing any business argument. Execute once with expectedStateHash and a fresh UUIDv7 requestId, then read the target back.",
