        "hint": "Edits matched non-complex Markdown blocks by exact old/new matching against the same AI-editable view returned by fs.read. Canonical input is edit={old,new}; shorthand old + new is also accepted. If the document contains complex SiYuan-native blocks, fs.replace skips those blocks and returns skippedComplexBlocks; matches only inside skipped blocks or across block boundaries are rejected without writing. For inline formatting, old should be plain text without Markdown style delimiters such as **, *, \`, or ~~; existing DOM inline styles are preserved. Naked ((id)) refs are normalized, and footnotes/siyuan://blocks links are allowed but do not create backlinks. replace_all=true replaces every exact match across editable blocks. Use ((id 'title')) for new double-links and #tag# for tags.",
