    "description": "📚 Grouped notebook operations. Use the "action" field to select the operation.

Common actions: list, create, set_open_state, rename, get_conf, get_child_docs. Required fields: list: no additional fields; create: name; set_open_state: notebook, opened; rename: notebook, name; get_conf: notebook; get_child_docs: notebook.

Additional actions: remove, set_conf, set_icon, get_permissions, set_permission. Read siyuan://help/action/notebook/{action} for details, or call action="help" if resources are unavailable.

Parameter contract per action (fields outside the action's optional list should not be sent):
notebook.list: required [] | optional []
notebook.create: required [name] | optional [icon]
notebook.set_open_state: required [notebook, opened] | optional []
notebook.remove: required [notebook] | optional []
notebook.rename: required [notebook, name] | optional []
notebook.get_conf: required [notebook] | optional []
notebook.set_conf: required [notebook, conf] | optional []
notebook.set_icon: required [notebook, icon] | optional []
notebook.get_permissions: required [] | optional [notebook]
notebook.set_permission: required [notebook, permission] | optional []
notebook.get_child_docs: required [notebook] | optional [page, pageSize]

Use notebook IDs for set_open_state, rename, get_conf, and set_conf. notebook(action="get_permissions") supports notebook="all" (or omission) for all notebooks, and a specific notebook ID for one notebook. Requires user confirmation before: remove, set_permission.",
    "overview": {
      "actionSummaries": {
        "create": "requires: name",
        "get_child_docs": "Use a notebook ID. Returns direct child documents at the notebook root, retries short initialization windows, and distinguishes notebook-not-found / closed-or-initializing failures.",
        "get_conf": "requires: notebook",
        "get_permissions": "Omit notebook or pass notebook="all" to return all notebook permissions. Pass a specific notebook ID to return one notebook only.",
        "list": "no extra fields",
        "remove": "This action requires explicit user confirmation.",
        "rename": "requires: notebook, name",
        "set_conf": "requires: notebook, conf",
        "set_icon": "Use a notebook ID + icon. Prefer a Unicode hex code string such as "1f4d4" for 📔; raw emoji characters may not render correctly.",
        "set_open_state": "requires: notebook, opened",
        "set_permission": "requires: notebook, permission",
      },
      "actions": {
        "create": {
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "get_child_docs": {
          "hint": "Use a notebook ID. Returns direct child documents at the notebook root, retries short initialization windows, and distinguishes notebook-not-found / closed-or-initializing failures.",
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "get_conf": {
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "get_permissions": {
          "hint": "Omit notebook or pass notebook="all" to return all notebook permissions. Pass a specific notebook ID to return one notebook only.",
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "list": {
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "remove": {
          "hint": "This action requires explicit user confirmation.",
          "requiresConfirmation": true,
        },
        "rename": {
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "set_conf": {
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "set_icon": {
          "hint": "Use a notebook ID + icon. Prefer a Unicode hex code string such as "1f4d4" for 📔; raw emoji characters may not render correctly.",
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "set_open_state": {
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
        },
        "set_permission": {
          "requiresConfirmation": true,
        },
      },
      "advancedActions": [
        "remove",
        "set_conf",
        "set_icon",
        "get_permissions",
        "set_permission",
      ],
      "commonActions": [
        "list",
        "create",
